Session 2 recap, as read aloud at the start of session 3

The company crossed the Marrow Coast in three days. They reached Saltgate during the
Bell Mass, learned that the dawn bell had rung twice, and took Captain Quillon's
commission to find out why. They did not yet know the third bell was not a bell at all.

